  "Default": "Predvolené",
  "Define document managers and their scope. They have a dedicated document management workspace rather than access to all administrative settings.": "Určte správcov dokumentov a ich rozsah. Majú samostatný pracovný priestor pre dokumenty, nie všetky administratívne nastavenia.",
